            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9314, Four Petal Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Solid Brass Four Petal Cabinet Knob made by RK International features a unique cut-out design that is reminiscent of floral shapes. It is available in 5 finishes including satin nickel (pictured right) and oil rubbed bronze. This cabinet door pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and comes packaged with the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9314 Solid Four Petal Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
